st 14 days, highlighting the intensity and impact of your cardio activities.</p>"},{"chart":"weekly-load","title":"3. Weekly Load Progression","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This graph shows your total training load, combining lifting volume and running distance, aggregated week-over-week. It helps in assessing your long-term training progression and avoiding overtraining.</p>"},{"chart":"fueling","title":"4. Fueling vs Output","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This chart compares your daily caloric intake (consumed) with your estimated caloric expenditure (burned) over the past 14 days, offering insights into your energy balance for recovery and performance.</p>"},{"chart":"recovery-trends","title":"5. Recovery Response","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This graph illustrates your key recovery metrics, including WHOOP Recovery, Garmin Body Battery, Eight Sleep Score, and Speediance app Recovery, providing a comprehensive view of your physiological readiness and response to training.</p>"},{"html":"<div class=\"footer\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;\"><p><a href=\"./historical_progress_report_2026-11-09.html\" style=\"color: #007AFF; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">🔗 Dashboard Link: Full Historical Progress</a></p></div>"}]}
